      "sc:description": "An interactive in silico biophysical risk calculator evaluating the Host-Tumor Biophysical Index (HTBI) across post-resection solid oncology cohorts. Computes continuous cellular polarity loss, microvascular desmoplasia resistance, and systemic inflammatory tension to model recurrence kinetics and ctDNA lead times.",
